# Dance Dance Revolution Solo Bass Mix (GQ894 VER. JAA), Konami 1999: the first power-on from blank
# NVRAM. The CD asks "DO YOU WANT TO INITIALIZE FLASH-ROM?"; Test answers yes, and the flash is
# erased and filled: "FLASH-ROM INITIALIZE COMPLETE" by frame ~11000. Hashes the main RAM every
# frame and snapshots every 60 frames, to compare with MAME.
game ddrsbm

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 1500 press "Service Mode" 8
from 0 every 60 snap
at 12000 quit
